    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #360\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nBranch pushed successfully.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented issue #149 by integrating `writeNotification` into all four required producer categories, each writing in the same transaction as its source write:\n\n- **`approval_pending`** — `mcpInvokeTool.ts`'s `createApprovalGatedMcpInvokeTool`, keyed on the new approval request's own id.\n- **`agent_run_error`** — one shared `finishAgentRunWithErrorNotification` helper in `agentRunsStore.ts`, reused by all 5 real call sites (startup-sweep repair, delegation registry, Semp conversation, the `core.agentRun` scheduler action, and `runAgentSession`), keyed on the run's id.\n- **`automation_error`** — `libraryMetadataJob.ts`'s `handleProcessLibraryMetadataTask`, keyed on the graphile-worker job id.\n- **`mail_sync_error`** — `mailSyncJob.ts`'s `handleSyncMailAccountTask`, same job-id keying, excluding the connection-limit-backoff branch (contention, not failure).\n\nAdded replay-dedup and rollback-atomicity tests for every producer. Full verification passed: build (all 11 packages), lint, dependency-boundary check, and the entire test suite (127 unit + 822 integration + 5 e2e tests, all green).\n\nBranch: `bb/relay-149-notifications-v1-02-05-integrate-the-n-thr_zxz82mqadx` — pushed to origin.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
